# The same sixteen-word memory as `logicram_ice40` and `logicram_ecp5`,
# below the block RAM threshold, on a family whose distributed RAM is
# one bit wide and sixty-four deep: eight `RAM64X1D` side by side, one
# per data bit, with the design's four address bits on the low four of
# the six address pins and no read multiplexer at all. Reticle reads
# that shape off the port list in the device file rather than from
# anything written in Rust.
set_io -io_standard LVCMOS33 clk W5
set_io -io_standard LVCMOS33 we V17
create_clock -name sys -period 10.0 clk
